Infuse your two handed weapon with light while spinning around.

All creatures in radius one take [85%, 100%, 111%, 121%, 130% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.

In addition while spinning your weapon shines so much it deals [83%, 105%, 122%, 137%, 150% (TL1-5)] light weapon damage to all foes in radius 2.

At level 4 your spinning blade creates a shield that blocks all damage for 1 turn.
